--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADHKAR TEXTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Shared/adhkar.json contains verses of the Quran and hadith from the classical
collections (Bukhari, Muslim, Abu Dawud, Tirmidhi, Nasa'i, Ibn Majah, Ahmad).
These classical texts are in the public domain. Each entry carries its citation.
